<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61660" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαιμός</span></b>  (A), ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throat, gullet</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always of men, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλε δουρὶ λαιμὸν ὑπ᾽ ἀνθερεῶνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.388
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν δ᾽ Ὀδυσεὺς κατὰ λαιμὸν . . βάλεν
					ἰῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					22.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ πως ἂν ἔμοιγε φίλον κατὰ λαιμὸν
					ἰείη οὐ πόσις οὐδὲ βρῶσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.209
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ἀπαμήσειε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.34
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>neck</i> of a bottle, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.232
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>): also in pl., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1092
			</span></i>; so of animals, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				1201
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1560
			</span></i>.—Rare in early Prose, as <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Cord.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, but commoner later, as <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nigr.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.656
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				6.193b
			</span></i>.</div>
